  "research_notes": "Final synthesis: accepted robust dataset-level associations are feature_010 = 1 -> higher outcome_001; feature_002 = 1 -> higher outcome_001; feature_037 = 1 -> lower outcome_001 / stronger dependency. These are large, replicated, and robust across many strata, including feature_019 quartile-extreme tests. Core interactions among feature_010, feature_002, and feature_037 are not supported; validation of H90 near-zero interaction supports additivity. H93 feature_003 triple-negative validated near-threshold signed +0.1415, independent bounds +0.0524 to +0.2305, remains unresolved and closed: not accepted because below threshold and not decisively rejected because interval includes threshold. Most informative next analysis: targeted confirmatory feature_003 assessment in new data or integrated multivariable model to resolve whether the near-threshold negative association exceeds +0.15. All conclusions are observational associations in the supplied dataset only, not causal, mechanistic, or external generalizability claims."
